          "short": "$-\\frac{9}{16}$",
          "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}-x^2&=-\\left(-\\frac{3}{4}\\right)^2\\\\-x^2&=-\\frac{9}{16}\\end{align*}$$",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 28
      },
      {
        "id": "p12-q5-f",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "f",
        "prompt": "$(-2x)^2$",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$2\\frac{1}{4}$",
          "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}(-2x)^2&=\\left(-2\\times\\left(-\\frac{3}{4}\\right)\\right)^2\\\\(-2x)^2&=\\left(\\frac{3}{2}\\right)^2\\\\(-2x)^2&=\\frac{9}{4}\\\\(-2x)^2&=2\\frac{1}{4}\\end{align*}$$",
