          "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}-2x^2&=-2\\times\\left(-\\frac{3}{4}\\right)^2\\\\-2x^2&=-2\\times\\frac{9}{16}\\\\-2x^2&=-\\frac{9}{8}\\\\-2x^2&=-1\\frac{1}{8}\\end{align*}$$",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 38
      },
      {
        "id": "p12-q5-h",
